 "result": "All 909 tests pass. I applied the upstream Jinja2 security fix (GHSA-cpwx-vrp4-4pq7):\n\n- `src/jinja2/filters.py`: `do_attr` now delegates to `environment.getattr()` instead of doing a raw `getattr()` + manual sandbox check. This ensures the `SandboxedEnvironment`'s overridden `getattr` (which wraps `str.format`/`format_map` and applies `is_safe_attribute`) is actually used, closing a bypass where `{{ obj|attr(\"format\") }}` could reach unwrapped format methods in sandboxed templates. `getattr_static` is used first to check attribute existence without triggering descriptors, preserving `attr`'s \"no item-lookup fallback\" semantics.\n- `CHANGES.rst`: added the changelog entry.\n- `tests/test_security.py`: added the upstream regression test demonstrating the sandbox bypass is closed.",
